        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00105",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains to the caregiver why proposed surgery, alternative CT follow-up, and discharge education are different kinds of evidence.",
          "quote": "你理解得非常准确。这句话的意思是，从已经完成的常规检查来看，没有发现绝对禁止手术的重大问题…"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model reconstructs the clinical timeline by separating the initial CT finding, preoperative evaluation, proposed surgery, and unresolved surveillance plan. It uses dialogue and workspace evidence to refine the timeline and explains to the caregiver which missing document would settle each uncertainty. This synthesis drove the entire plan and defused confusion.",
